        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Grandma Raccoon’s pixel home and help her bring order to everyday chaos. Relax, organize, and take joy in the little things with Raccoon Cocoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹✨ <i>Cozy puzzles, gentle vibes. That’s the spirit!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you inside this warm little cocoon?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize drawers, tidy shelves, and arrange all sorts of cozy clutter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up buttons, sort plants, and find comfort in calm routines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together charming little jigsaw puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy peaceful, tactile satisfaction through 60 relaxing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No timers, no stress — just pure cozy vibes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐾</strong> <strong>Whether you’re organizing a sewing box or finding the right spot for a glowing bulb, every puzzle is a quiet little moment with Grandma Raccoon. Put the kettle on and take your time — she’s in no rush.</strong> 🍵</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/b3528c181f4b674bff19c719d311dd67.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/b3528c181f4b674bff19c719d311dd67.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/b3528c181f4b674bff19c719d311dd67.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Grandma Raccoon’s pixel home and help her bring order to everyday chaos. Relax, organize, and take joy in the little things with Raccoon Cocoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹✨ <i>Cozy puzzles, gentle vibes. That’s the spirit!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/444232bb5517a7d5ae1fd90745b11be4.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What awaits you inside this warm little cocoon?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize drawers, tidy shelves, and arrange all sorts of cozy clutter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up buttons, sort plants, and find comfort in calm routines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together charming little jigsaw puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy peaceful, tactile satisfaction through 60 relaxing levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No timers, no stress — just pure cozy vibes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/d76d5f72cd73d148ec79bcc8db34baf0.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐾</strong> <strong>Whether you’re organizing a sewing box or finding the right spot for a glowing bulb, every puzzle is a quiet little moment with Grandma Raccoon. Put the kettle on and take your time — she’s in no rush.</strong> 🍵</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/b3528c181f4b674bff19c719d311dd67.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/b3528c181f4b674bff19c719d311dd67.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/b3528c181f4b674bff19c719d311dd67.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.poster.avif?t=1777482865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.webm?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/96b6effc77b45692e96c880226beaadb.mp4?t=1777482865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
